% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/ai_act/scope_and_roles. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% This domain has no commissioning register: parameters-sources.yaml lists
% no keys. The only statutory figures of the order are the application days
% of Art 113, third paragraph, points (a) and (c) of Regulation (EU)
% 2024/1689 (2 February 2025, 2 December 2027, 2 August 2028) and the day
% from which the pinned consolidated text is valid (27 July 2026). They are
% owned, with their cite(...) provenance, by the determination slice
% scope_and_roles.clausal, and their wording is recorded under the citation
% keys eu_reg_2024_1689_art_113_a, eu_reg_2024_1689_art_113_c_i and
% eu_reg_2024_1689_art_113_c_ii in citations-sources.yaml.
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
